From d1de9c907940ad071f7d9bf8133505730d8cd801 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:02:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban: record portable_reason on every created
 event; fenced evidence is not a host need

Self-heal kanban-12ee0e4b65: 13 of 172 hub cards in 3 days were enrolled worker-first and nothing recorded why
the rest stayed on the hub (the investigation had to replay portable_reason). Every create (CLI and kanban_create)
now writes {portable_reason: <why> | null} into its created event when a worker pool is configured. Producers can
fence quoted incident evidence with <!-- placement:evidence --> ... <!-- /placement:evidence --> so a proposal that
says what happened on the hub no longer pins a repo fix there; only complete pairs are removed and the title is
never fenced.
---
